you're right, leave and come back when you have see invisible (if you
find the potion, bless it before drinking it) and some means of taking
the nymph down from a distance. Daggers are good but you know, whatever
works.

In your shoes I'd probably escape up to the stash rather than down
(where the uglier monsters lurk), kit out with whatever gear is in the
stash and then try to take on the mines. You can pick up good armour
and weapons there, and there's another altar avaialbel. With a bit of
luck you might pick up everything you need to deal with the nymph.

Another decent strategy for dealing with invisible thieves (you get
used to them playing slashem - damn pixies) is to get a crudload of
pets and then back yourself in to a corner of a large room (on top of a
few E-words, naturally), and wait. The pets will all mill around near
you and attack the thief as it approaches. If you're lucky they will
kill it, or at least signpost it enough that you can kill it, before it
steals any more gear from you. 

Good luck...



